invalid type: string "BOEING 737–300/400/500                           Engine CFM56\n\nIntroduction\n\nThe starting system is powered by the pneumatic starting system for the\nmotor.\n\nThe air of the pneumatic system can come from three different sources:\n\n      •      APU\n      •      External Pneumatic Source\n      •      Opposed Motor\n\nIT\n\n STOW is commanded\n\ndeactivated.\n\n